437
00:54:28,020 --> 00:54:29,700
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: do we have the appropriate policy?

438
00:54:30,700 --> 00:54:31,540
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: Number two,

439
00:54:32,660 --> 00:54:39,620
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: do we have mitigating measures na ibaba yung interaction na yun?

440
00:54:39,780 --> 00:54:45,140
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: Kasi, ang tingin nila, threatened na ang Irawadi Dolphins in the Philippines.

441
00:54:45,140 --> 00:54:48,140
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: So, ang ginawa natin is,

442
00:54:49,340 --> 00:54:53,140
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: we passed fisheries administrative order

443
00:54:53,700 --> 00:54:55,140
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: limiting the length,

444
00:54:55,840 --> 00:55:04,840
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: the length of the gill nets kasi nakakaratingin ng more than 1 kilometer into 500 meters.

445
00:55:04,840 --> 00:55:07,840
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: So, yun ang ating policy measure na nilagay.

446
00:55:07,840 --> 00:55:11,000
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: And then, in-assist natin ang mga LGU

447
00:55:11,000 --> 00:55:18,640
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: to make sure that they have crafted their local ordinance to mitigate this.

448
00:55:19,120 --> 00:55:20,580
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: So, yun po ang ating ginawa.

449
00:55:20,580 --> 00:55:22,780
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: And we will report to them

450
00:55:22,780 --> 00:55:25,820
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: in the last quarter of this year,

451
00:55:25,820 --> 00:55:28,820
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: we need to give them an update po

452
00:55:28,820 --> 00:55:34,820
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: kung na totally na ang commitment natin na in place na lahat.

453
00:55:34,820 --> 00:55:39,820
DA Undersecretary Drusila Esther E. Bayate: So, tinutulungan natin lahat ngayon ang ating mga local government units

454
00:55:39,820 --> 00:55:42,820
