01:36:48,840 --> 01:36:49,620
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Asik Joycel?

841
01:36:51,280 --> 01:36:52,540
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Maraming salamat, Mr. Chair.

842
01:36:52,540 --> 01:37:00,040
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Bago natin pakinggan, amingin ko na rin po yung detalye dun sa sinabi ni Secretary na may nang-aabuso, may nandadaya.

843
01:37:00,460 --> 01:37:01,700
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May naimbestigahan ba tayo?

844
01:37:01,720 --> 01:37:04,100
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: May nahabol, may napanagot pagdating dito?

845
01:37:05,200 --> 01:37:17,520
DA Secretary Francisco P. Tiu Laurel Jr.: Sa ngayon, mayroon tayong iniimbestigahan na mga rice supplier sa mga LGU na instead of selling yung local rice,

