1606
02:39:37,360 --> 02:39:44,280
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: At a time when we must strengthen food security and prepare for the possible civil effects of El Nino and climate change,

1607
02:39:44,760 --> 02:39:47,520
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: irrigation cannot be treated as an ordinary expense.

1608
02:39:47,520 --> 02:39:52,720
NIA Administrator Eduardo Eddie G. Guillen: It is a strategic investment in agricultural productivity, rural development,

1609
02:39:52,840 --> 02:39:55,220
